.TH SDL_RemoveNotification 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_RemoveNotification \- Remove a notification.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_notification.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_RemoveNotification(SDL_NotificationID notification);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I notification
the ID of the notification to remove\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns True on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

